---
// Part 1 mental model: ten requests sorted from fastest to slowest. The p50 and p90 are actual
// requests; the average (244 ms) sits far above nine of them and far below the tenth.
// Values match examples/percentiles-and-tail-latency/python/percentiles.py.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 400 320" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="ptl-mm-t ptl-mm-d">
  <title id="ptl-mm-t">Ten requests sorted, with the average, p50 and p90</title>
  <desc id="ptl-mm-d">
    Ten bars, one per request, sorted from fastest to slowest: 40, 42, 45, 45, 48, 50, 52, 55 and
    60 milliseconds, then one bar of 2,000 milliseconds drawn with a break because it is far taller.
    The fifth bar, 48 ms, is marked p50. The ninth bar, 60 ms, is marked p90. The last is marked
    max. A dashed line marks the average, 244 ms: above nine of the bars and far below the tenth.
  </desc>
  <line x1="36" y1="270" x2="392" y2="270" stroke-width="1.5" style="stroke: var(--viz-stroke)" />
  <rect x="44" y="190" width="26" height="80" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="57" y="183" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">40</text>
  <rect x="78" y="186" width="26" height="84" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="91" y="179" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">42</text>
  <rect x="112" y="180" width="26" height="90" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="125" y="173" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">45</text>
  <rect x="146" y="180" width="26" height="90" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="159" y="173" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">45</text>
  <rect x="180" y="174" width="26" height="96" rx="3" stroke-width="2.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-ink)" />
  <text x="193" y="167" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">48</text>
  <rect x="214" y="170" width="26" height="100" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="227" y="163" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">50</text>
  <rect x="248" y="166" width="26" height="104" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="261" y="159" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">52</text>
  <rect x="282" y="160" width="26" height="110" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-flow)" />
  <text x="295" y="153" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">55</text>
  <rect x="316" y="150" width="26" height="120" rx="3" stroke-width="2.5" style="fill: var(--viz-flow-soft); stroke: var(--viz-ink)" />
  <text x="329" y="143" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">60</text>
  <rect x="350" y="152" width="26" height="118" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <rect x="350" y="40" width="26" height="98" rx="3" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)" />
  <line x1="346" y1="148" x2="380" y2="140" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-muted)" />
  <line x1="346" y1="156" x2="380" y2="148" stroke-width="2" style="stroke: var(--viz-muted)" />
  <text x="342" y="62" font-size="15" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">2,000</text>
  <line x1="36" y1="118" x2="330" y2="118" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 5" style="stroke: var(--viz-ink)" />
  <text x="40" y="108" font-size="17" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">average: 244 ms</text>
  <text x="40" y="88" font-size="15" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">nobody waited this long</text>
  <text x="193" y="292" font-size="16" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">p50</text>
  <text x="329" y="292" font-size="16" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">p90</text>
  <text x="363" y="292" font-size="16" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">max</text>
  <text x="214" y="314" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">10 requests, fastest to slowest, in ms</text>
</svg>
